.TH WERKMEISTER-SKILLS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-skills \- Workspace w9r\-* skill projection: verify freshness against the werkmeister repo (check) or rewrite it (sync)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister skills\fR <action>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Keeps a workspace's context layer fresh. \fBcheck\fR renders it again and diffs that with what is on disk, exiting 1 with a per\-entry report when anything is stale. \fBsync\fR rewrites whatever \fBcheck\fR reports. What counts as the context layer depends on the workspace's strategy: for jit, the w9r\-* skills in \fB.claude/skills/\fR and the gate manifest; for icm, \fB_shared/standards.md\fR and the stage contracts.
.PP
Run it from anywhere inside a workspace.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister skills check
werkmeister skills sync
.RE
.fi
.SH EXIT CODES
.PP
0 when fresh (or synced), 1 when \fBcheck\fR finds drift.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
